  "ruleText": "Ed 1113.05 Emergency Intervention Procedures. All crisis or emergency intervention procedures shall be included in the student’s IEP and shall comply with Ed 1113.04 and RSA 126-U:5\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #10590, eff 5-15-14; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
